  ],
  "evidence_gaps": [
    "No direct scopolamine oral bioavailability or human absorption record is supplied.",
    "No direct scopolamine gut-wall efflux or intestinal metabolism record is supplied; L5 evidence is analog-based.",
    "Tropisetron F_G 0.75 is estimated by a DDI method and is not a scopolamine measurement.",
    "Quaternary efflux records are not transferable, and benztropine P-gp efflux lacks an oral F endpoint.",
    "Hepatic clearance and metabolic stability for scopolamine are not yet assessed at L6."
